IA 1.6 L 8V SOHC L4 (1994 a 1996) DadosTecnicos:', 43.2, 43.2, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > Injection', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134201-820lh-mqy4p5ujvax22a', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1297577243%2F23198098993', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
