essories > Desktop & Laptop Components > Power Supply Units', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-8259f-mqsk41iu27eq45', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F801641954%2F22494221080', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
