infantil preto tenis infantil de menino tenis infantil volta as aulas tenis infantil preto menino', 199.9, 76.9, NULL, 'Baby & Kids Fashion > Boy Shoes > Sneakers', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-81z1k-mf4c30qb0yyt35', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F499950777%2F40821723871', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
