zul Brilhante 42090), Acid Blue 9 (Azul Brilhante).', 99.9, 99.9, NULL, 'Beauty > Makeup > Face', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134201-820l7-mqyl8t3m0mise6', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1314305321%2F58211410088', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
